        <div class="savings-strip-head">
          <span class="savings-strip-main">
            <span class="savings-primary-pill" title="Physical tokens saved in this conversation">
              <strong class="savings-primary-val" id="tufteSavedTokensLabel">+0.0k</strong>
              <span>saved this chat</span>
            </span>
            <span class="savings-scope-sub" id="tufteSavedUsd"></span>
            <span class="savings-scope-sub">&middot;</span>
            <span class="savings-scope-sub" id="tufteWorkspaceSavedLabel">+0.0k</span>
            <span class="savings-scope-sub" title="Tokens saved across all your chats in this workspace over the last 30 days">30d</span>
          </span>
          <span id="tufteGuardsQuietLabel" hidden>32 guards quiet</span>
          <button type="button" class="savings-why-btn mono" id="btnToggleSavingsWhy" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="simpleSavingsWhyDrawer">[&#x25BE; Why]</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="savings-why-drawer mono" id="simpleSavingsWhyDrawer" hidden>
      <div class="savings-why-row"><span>Subagent context isolation</span><strong id="savSubagentVal">+0.0k</strong></div>
      <div class="savings-why-row"><span>Warm prompt cache (95% off)</span><strong id="savCacheVal">+0.0k</strong></div>
      <div class="savings-why-row"><span>CLI &amp; log compression</span><strong id="savCliVal">+0.0k</strong></div>
      <div class="savings-why-row"><span>Loops, re-reads &amp; trims avoided</span><strong id="savGuardsVal">+0.0k</strong></div>
      <div class="savings-why-foot">
        <span class="savings-scope-sub" id="savEstUsdLabel">Est. input value: $0.00</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn-copy-receipt mono" id="btnCopySimpleSavingsReceipt" title="Copy plain-English Verified Tokens Saved Receipt">[Copy Receipt]</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="simple-sec-intro"><span class="simple-sec-blurb">What happened in this chat, what the guard fixed for you, and the tokens that saved.</span></div>
    <div class="fr-zones-body" id="frZonesBody">
      <div class="fr-zone fr-timeline" id="timelineZone">
        <div class="fr-head">
          <span class="fr-title">Practice Pulse</span>
          <span class="fr-legend" aria-hidden="true"><i class="lg lg-good"></i>good <i class="lg lg-bad"></i>bad <i class="lg lg-neutral"></i>neutral <i class="lg lg-limit"></i>safe limit</span>
        </div>
        <div class="simple-sec-intro"><span class="simple-sec-blurb">Memory growth turn by turn. Green marks good habits, red marks wasteful ones.</span></div>
        <div class="tl-chart" id="timelineChart" role="group" aria-label="Per-turn context growth with good and bad practices"></div>
        <div class="tl-markers mono" id="timelineMarkers" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="tl-detail mono" id="timelineDetail" aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="fr-zone fr-log" id="autoFixZone">
        <div class="fr-head">
          <span class="fr-title">Auto-Guard Stream</span>
          <span class="fr-count mono" id="autoFixCount">0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="simple-sec-intro"><span class="simple-sec-blurb">Wasteful reads and loops the guard fixed automatically. Nothing to do.</span></div>
        <div class="fx-list mono" id="autoFixList" role="list"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="footer-meta mono" id="footerMeta">Live updates active</div>
  </div><!-- /#legacyCompatSurface -->
</div>
